AlertStudioPage.tsx already saves typed alert-rule payloads and has no legacy RuleBuilder references.
Visible editor still needs a signal picker, signal-type-scoped operators, and shared loading/error/empty handling for the channel/template surfaces.
=== REASONING ===
Signal type should drive allowed operators and the value editor so string and boolean signals cannot use numeric-only operators.
A local signal catalog derived from Alert Studio templates avoids adding an unverified API dependency while keeping existing unknown saved signals visible.
=== CHANGES ===
Derived a typed signal catalog from Alert Studio templates and replaced the free-form signal text field with a shared Select picker.
Scoped operator choices by selected signal type: numeric signals keep comparison/range operators while text and boolean signals only allow equality/change operators.
Removed the visible value-type selector and now render typed value, boolean, range, or any-change controls from the selected signal and operator.
Added shared EmptyState, Skeleton, and ErrorDisplay handling for template, rules, typed-value, and test-target empty/loading/error states.
